  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「セイヨウメギ」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%BB%E3%82%A4%E3%83%A8%E3%82%A6%E3%83%A1%E3%82%AE",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 106365392,
      "text": "セイヨウメギ は、メギ科メギ属の落葉低木である。食べられるが酸味の強い果実を付け、多くの国で食べられる。メギ属のタイプ種となっている。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Berberis vulgaris」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berberis_vulgaris",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1378745653,
      "text": "Berberis vulgaris, also known as common barberry, European barberry or simply barberry, is a shrub in the genus Berberis native to the Old World. It produces edible but sharply acidic berries, which people in many countries eat as a tart and refreshing fruit."
    }
  },
